|:--------------|-----------:|-------------:|----------:|-----------:|-------:|--------:|
| Intercept     |      1.207 |        0.019 |    64.106 |      0.000 |  1.171 |   1.244 |
| ivf_success   |      0.791 |        0.028 |    28.286 |      0.000 |  0.736 |   0.846 |
